  "title": "STM32C092 USART1 clocking issue",
  "content": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>I’m looking at a STM32C092 for some UART stuff. The data sheet has USART1 on an independent clock. Using MX I select USART1 as Asynchronous and MX calculates the rate according to the independent clock as expected,</p><p>However, when I select USART1 as Synchronous MX calculates the bit rate according to the APB clock. I don’t have a device to test it on.</p><p>Is MX right or wrong?</p><p>Thanks in advance</p><p>Pedro</p>",
